OL,3,GNEWSAMan charged after anti-migrant
OL,4,Aprotest
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been charged with violent
OL,7,Fdisorder following an anti-migrant
OL,8,Fdemonstration in Portsmouth.
OL,10,FA large crowd of protesters gathered
OL,11,Fnear Eastney Marina when a boat
OL,12,Fcarrying about 120 migrants was brought
OL,13,Fashore after crossing the Channel at
OL,14,Fnearby Eastney Beach on 6 September.
OL,16,FHampshire Police said 54-year-old Nigel
OL,17,FWylie, from Havant, had been charged
OL,18,Fwith violent disorder.
OL,23,APub: 21-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
