OL,4,Aprotest
OL,5,
OL,6,FWylie appeared at Portsmouth Crown
OL,7,FCourt on Saturday for an initial
OL,8,Fhearing and has been remanded into
OL,9,Fcustody until he returns to court on
OL,10,FWednesday.
